        "image": "assets/slide-2.png"
      },
      "storyboard": "a cluttered slide card titled 'Q3 update' with four bullet rows; the rows feel cramped and a faint noisy shimmer shows the clutter. On 'split it' the card shatters cleanly along the row lines into four fresh cards that fan out in a row, each with a bold single-sentence headline: 'Revenue grew again in Q3', 'Two enterprise customers signed', 'Small-business churn is rising', 'Hiring two account managers'. Land each new headline as the narrator says 'own headline'.",
